# Acadia hardware watchdog preset — enable the `watchdog` daemon.
#
# The upstream `watchdog` package ships watchdog.service disabled by
# default (SYSTEMD_AUTO_ENABLE = "disable").  Acadia enables it so the
# BCM2712 hardware watchdog (/dev/watchdog) provides a true
# boot-confirm-or-hardware-reset story alongside the OTA boot-watchdog.sh
# slot-confirmation logic.
enable watchdog.service
